cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FMLE: Fuzzy Mixture of Linear Experts for RNA-to-protein prediction"
message: "If you use FMLE, please cite this software."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Singh"
    given-names: "Vikas"
    email: "vikkysingh07@gmail.com"
license: "GPL-3.0"
version: "1.0.2"
date-released: "2026-04-14"
repository-code: "https://github.com/vikkyak/FMLE"
abstract: >
  FMLE is an R package implementing fuzzy mixture-of-linear-experts models
  for RNA-to-protein prediction from single-cell transcriptomic features.
  The repository includes code for preprocessing, benchmarking, and transfer
  analyses, and figure generation used in the associated manuscript.
